@startuml Hinh_2_4_Sequence_VNPay_Nap_Tien
title Hình 2.4 – Sequence: Tích hợp và xử lý nạp tiền VNPay
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "Web Frontend" as UI
participant "PaymentController" as PayCtrl
participant "PaymentService" as PaySvc
participant "VNPay Gateway" as VNPay
participant "TransactionService" as TxSvc
participant "LedgerService" as Ledger
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Kafka\nwallet.transactions" as Kafka

== Tạo URL thanh toán ==
User -> UI : Nhập số tiền nạp
UI -> PayCtrl : POST /api/payment/vnpay/create\n(amount, JWT)
PayCtrl -> PaySvc : createPaymentUrl(userId, amount)
PaySvc -> DB : Tạo PaymentOrder (PENDING)
PaySvc -> PaySvc : Ký HMAC-SHA512 (VnpayUtil)
PaySvc --> PayCtrl : paymentUrl
PayCtrl --> UI : Redirect URL
UI -> VNPay : Chuyển hướng người dùng

== Xác nhận thanh toán ==
VNPay --> UI : Redirect /vnpay-return?params
UI -> PayCtrl : POST /api/payment/vnpay/confirm
PayCtrl -> PaySvc : confirmPayment(params)
PaySvc -> PaySvc : Xác minh chữ ký + số tiền

alt Thanh toán thành công
  PaySvc -> TxSvc : topUp(userId, amount)
  TxSvc -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
  TxSvc -> Ledger : CREDIT Account (double-entry)
  TxSvc -> DB : Lưu Transaction (TOPUP, SUCCESS)
  TxSvc -> DB : COMMIT
  TxSvc -> Kafka : publish(TransactionEvent)
  PaySvc -> DB : PaymentOrder = SUCCESS
else Thanh toán thất bại / chữ ký sai
  PaySvc -> DB : PaymentOrder = FAILED
end

PayCtrl --> UI : Kết quả nạp tiền
UI --> User : Cập nhật số dư

note over VNPay, PaySvc
  IPN: POST /api/payment/vnpay/ipn (permitAll)
  Dùng khi production có callback server-to-server
end note

@enduml
